{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>AFTER ARRIVING AT RAVENHILLE, A TRUE CHALLENGE AWAITS YOU. DELVE INTO THE CURSED FOREST AND KILL THE ANCIENT BEAST THAT CAME FROM HELL - BEFORE IT\u2019S TOO LATE.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678080/extras/2025-05-0721-14-15-ezgif.com-resize.gif?t=1747165850\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Find and hunt down the beast.</strong> It hides in the darkness, watching your every move. This creature wasn\u2019t born, it was made, then left to rot in the forest. A single bullet won\u2019t stop it. If you miss, you may not get a second chance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678080/extras/explore.gif?t=1747165850\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i><strong>Explore</strong></i> the forgotten village and the cursed forest that <strong><i>hides the darkest secrets</i></strong>. No matter how peaceful it seems, nothing truly is. Use your <strong><i>Karabiner 98k</i></strong> and your sword to protect yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678080/extras/loot.gif?t=1747165850\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Loot <strong><i>forgotten relics</i></strong>, <i><strong>keys</strong></i>, <i><strong>skill books</strong></i>, ammo, and money. Every item holds a story or a secret. Use your coins in the shop to buy useful tools, upgrades, and strange curiosities. Saving up for something valuable might be worth it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678080/extras/cave1.gif?t=1747165850\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i><strong>Wander through strange places, caves</strong></i>\u00a0and cursed structures. But one thing matters most: stay alert. The creatures that dwell here have learned to hide well in the dark.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3678080?t=1747165850","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678080/579106b0abe3c15aab5a384bb7f427d31a703044/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1747165850","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678080/6e00ed655ef3cf5c767893462b450fa49397fe96/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747165850","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678080/6e00ed655ef3cf5c767893462b450fa49397fe96/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747165850","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3702570,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>AFTER ARRIVING AT RAVENHILLE, A TRUE CHALLENGE AWAITS YOU. DELVE INTO THE CURSED FOREST AND KILL THE ANCIENT BEAST THAT CAME FROM HELL - BEFORE IT\u2019S TOO LATE.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678080/extras/2025-05-0721-14-15-ezgif.com-resize.gif?t=1747165850\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Find and hunt down the beast.</strong> It hides in the darkness, watching your every move. This creature wasn\u2019t born, it was made, then left to rot in the forest. A single bullet won\u2019t stop it. If you miss, you may not get a second chance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678080/extras/explore.gif?t=1747165850\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i><strong>Explore</strong></i> the forgotten village and the cursed forest that <strong><i>hides the darkest secrets</i></strong>. No matter how peaceful it seems, nothing truly is. Use your <strong><i>Karabiner 98k</i></strong> and your sword to protect yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678080/extras/loot.gif?t=1747165850\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Loot <strong><i>forgotten relics</i></strong>, <i><strong>keys</strong></i>, <i><strong>skill books</strong></i>, ammo, and money. Every item holds a story or a secret. Use your coins in the shop to buy useful tools, upgrades, and strange curiosities. Saving up for something valuable might be worth it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678080/extras/cave1.gif?t=1747165850\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i><strong>Wander through strange places, caves</strong></i>\u00a0and cursed structures. But one thing matters most: stay alert. The creatures that dwell here have learned to hide well in the dark.</p>","developers":["QuantumPixel"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678080/6ae26881693714bceed122865dbe05a14c038ff1/header.jpg?t=1747165850","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257136592,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257136592/movie480.mp4?t=1746985989","max":"http://video.akamai.ste